data: {"id": "1ee2c40ec86742c3-thinking-parallel_evidence-1501", "run_id": "1ee2c40ec86742c3", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 调查结论\n\n### 已采集事实\n\n**1. Pod 当前状态**\n- `workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` 处于 **Pending** 状态，容器状态为 `Waiting / ContainerCreating`。\n- 未分配 Container ID，说明容器尚未启动。\n\n**2. 根因证据（来自 events + describe）**\n- **直接原因**：Volume `input`（类型为 ConfigMap）挂载失败。\n- **根本原因**：ConfigMap `unavailable-config` **不存在**（`configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`）。\n- 该事件已持续 **75 分钟**，反复出现（x45 次 MountVolume.SetUp 失败，x31 次 volume 挂载超时）。\n- ConfigMap 引用为 `Optional: false`（必需），因此挂载必然失败，Pod 无法进入 Running 状态。\n\n**3. 与初始状态的一致性**\n- 用户提供的初始状态\"Conta", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788420450880, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "1ee2c40ec86742c3-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "1ee2c40ec86742c3", "seq": 1502, "ts_ms": 1788420458934, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 92.729, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-03", "name": "workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/1ee2c40ec86742c3-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "2c520bf9a071faa1787f64553aba99fe51bcc867233a4af0ce0e0aa882189245", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "5f64cb965ba2df8acdd292627eefca6e619d52f27c6f7a875af35c71a661ad19"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "1ee2c40ec86742c3-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "1ee2c40ec86742c3", "seq": 1503, "ts_ms": 1788420458935, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "1ee2c40ec86742c3-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "1ee2c40ec86742c3", "seq": 1504, "ts_ms": 1788420468421, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 9.487, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1795, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态，容器无法启动 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (fact-0abec980dcbb) | 直接定位失败原因：ConfigMap 不存在，导致 Volume 挂载被阻塞 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod 条件 `ContainersReady=False`, `Ready=False`, 状态 `phase=Pending` (fact-203cb74d382f) | 确认 Pod 处于等待挂载的阻塞状态，符合故障现象 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | 容器状态 `container.waiting_reason=ContainerCreating` (fact-ac0adeeb7d13) | 确认具体等待原因是 Volume 挂载未完成，而非资源不足或镜像拉取失败 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | Volume 'input' 的挂载配置指向不存在的 `configmap \"unavailable-config\"` (结合 Event 事实) | 建立配置项与实际资源的引用断裂，证实引用配置错误 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\", container=\"app\"} = 1` (fact-308daca6f888) | 独立监控指标印证了 Kubernetes 状态的等待机制，排除了 Pod 处于其他异常状态的可能性 |\n\n**证据链说明**：\nKubernetes 事件与状态（事实 1、2、3）明确指向 Volume 挂载失败，错误信息精确到具体的资源缺失。Metric 数据（事实 5）从监控维度交叉验证了容器处于相同的 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态，确认了该现象的持续性和一致性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 不存在 → Kubelet 挂载 Volume 'input' 持续失败 → Pod 卡死在 Pending 状态 (ContainerCreating) → 容器无法启动\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**根因确认**：\nPod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` 无法启动的根本原因是 **Volume 挂载配置引用了不存在的依赖资源**。具体而言，Pod Spec 中定义的 Volume `input` 引用了 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，但该资源在 `aiops-case-03` 命名空间中缺失。\n\n**证据支撑**：\n这一因果关系由直接的工具事实支撑：Kubernetes Event `MountVolume.SetUp failed` (事实 1) 明确指出 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`，且该事件反复出现（`x40 over 74m`）；同时容器一直保持在 `ContainerCreating` 状态等待挂载完成（事实 2、3）。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态，容器无法启动 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (fact-0abec980dcbb) | 直接定位失败原因：ConfigMap 不存在，导致 Volume 挂载被阻塞 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod 条件 `ContainersReady=False`, `Ready=False`, 状态 `phase=Pending` (fact-203cb74d382f) | 确认 Pod 处于等待挂载的阻塞状态，符合故障现象 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | 容器状态 `container.waiting_reason=ContainerCreating` (fact-ac0adeeb7d13) | 确认具体等待原因是 Volume 挂载未完成，而非资源不足或镜像拉取失败 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | Volume 'input' 的挂载配置指向不存在的 `configmap \"unavailable-config\"` (结合 Event 事实) | 建立配置项与实际资源的引用断裂，证实引用配置错误 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\", container=\"app\"} = 1` (fact-308daca6f888) | 独立监控指标印证了 Kubernetes 状态的等待机制，排除了 Pod 处于其他异常状态的可能性 |\n\n**证据链说明**：\nKubernetes 事件与状态（事实 1、2、3）明确指向 Volume 挂载失败，错误信息精确到具体的资源缺失。Metric 数据（事实 5）从监控维度交叉验证了容器处于相同的 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态，确认了该现象的持续性和一致性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 不存在 → Kubelet 挂载 Volume 'input' 持续失败 → Pod 卡死在 Pending 状态 (ContainerCreating) → 容器无法启动\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**根因确认**：\nPod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` 无法启动的根本原因是 **Volume 挂载配置引用了不存在的依赖资源**。具体而言，Pod Spec 中定义的 Volume `input` 引用了 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，但该资源在 `aiops-case-03` 命名空间中缺失。\n\n**证据支撑**：\n这一因果关系由直接的工具事实支撑：Kubernetes Event `MountVolume.SetUp failed` (事实 1) 明确指出 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`，且该事件反复出现（`x40 over 74m`）；同时容器一直保持在 `ContainerCreating` 状态等待挂载完成（事实 2、3）。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "1ee2c40ec86742c3-final", "run_id": "1ee2c40ec86742c3", "seq": 1506, "ts_ms": 1788420468440, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w 处于 Pending/ContainerCreating 状态，容器无法启动 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Warning FailedMount ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (fact-0abec980dcbb) | 直接定位失败原因：ConfigMap 不存在，导致 Volume 挂载被阻塞 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | Pod 条件 `ContainersReady=False`, `Ready=False`, 状态 `phase=Pending` (fact-203cb74d382f) | 确认 Pod 处于等待挂载的阻塞状态，符合故障现象 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | 容器状态 `container.waiting_reason=ContainerCreating` (fact-ac0adeeb7d13) | 确认具体等待原因是 Volume 挂载未完成，而非资源不足或镜像拉取失败 |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes | Volume 'input' 的挂载配置指向不存在的 `configmap \"unavailable-config\"` (结合 Event 事实) | 建立配置项与实际资源的引用断裂，证实引用配置错误 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\", container=\"app\"} = 1` (fact-308daca6f888) | 独立监控指标印证了 Kubernetes 状态的等待机制，排除了 Pod 处于其他异常状态的可能性 |\n\n**证据链说明**：\nKubernetes 事件与状态（事实 1、2、3）明确指向 Volume 挂载失败，错误信息精确到具体的资源缺失。Metric 数据（事实 5）从监控维度交叉验证了容器处于相同的 `ContainerCreating` 等待状态，确认了该现象的持续性和一致性。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 不存在 → Kubelet 挂载 Volume 'input' 持续失败 → Pod 卡死在 Pending 状态 (ContainerCreating) → 容器无法启动\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**根因确认**：\nPod `workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` 无法启动的根本原因是 **Volume 挂载配置引用了不存在的依赖资源**。具体而言，Pod Spec 中定义的 Volume `input` 引用了 ConfigMap `unavailable-config`，但该资源在 `aiops-case-03` 命名空间中缺失。\n\n**证据支撑**：\n这一因果关系由直接的工具事实支撑：Kubernetes Event `MountVolume.SetUp failed` (事实 1) 明确指出 `configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`，且该事件反复出现（`x40 over 74m`）；同时容器一直保持在 `ContainerCreating` 状态等待挂载完成（事实 2、3）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 2.1m\n├─ 问题定位: 26.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 92.7s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w: 92.7s (Evidence 84.7s, RCA 7.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-imagepull-failed, pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 128.923, "metrics": {"run_id": "1ee2c40ec86742c3", "mttr": {"value": "2.1m", "seconds": 128.92643690109253, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "45%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-pending-unschedulable, pod-sandbox-create-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 128926.43